# A .rc file of your own must not switch off the generated version resource. RiftBuild only
# stands aside when the script declares its own VERSIONINFO, which is the case that collides at
# link time. custom.rc here carries an icon and nothing else, so the exe has to end up with both
# that icon and the metadata below. main.c looks for each of them at runtime.
Assembly            CustomRcMetadataTest
SourceFiles         main
SourceFiles:windows custom

TitleName           Custom Rc Metadata
CompanyName         Artisan Softworks
Description         Metadata has to survive a custom .rc
Version             3.2.1
Copyright           Copyright (c) $CompanyName
